am and fm, every parameter off its default
model vsource vsource
v1 (a 0) vsource type="am" sinedc=0.5 ampl=2 freq=10k tdphase=30 delay=20u modfreq=1k modphase=45 modindex=0.7
v2 (b 0) vsource type="fm" sinedc=0.5 ampl=2 freq=10k tdphase=30 delay=20u modfreq=1k modphase=45 modindex=0.7
control
  options rawfile="ascii"
  analysis op1 op
  analysis tr1 tran stop=1m step=1n maxstep=0.5u
endc
